        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBS2018, Sobe 12\" Solid Brass Shelf</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe contemporary design of the Sobe Series Shelf makes is perfect for modern styled homes. This 12\" Solid Brass shelf has concealed screw mounting for a sleek look. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS2018-specifications.gif?v=1704354623\" width=\"600\" height=\"309\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBS2018 Solid Brass 12\" Shelf Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/18-inch-solid-brass-shelf-deltana-bbs2019\"><b>18\" Sobe Solid Brass Shelf</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBS Sobe Series\"><b>Deltana Sobe Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Sobe 12 Inch Bathroom Shelf:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 9-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting for a clean, contemporary look.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS2018.pdf?v=1691095352\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBS2018 Solid Brass 12\" Shelf Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 shelf, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
